// -------------------------  ANIMATION RELATED FIELDS --------------------------------//
	ModeBits		ANIM_WALK                                          

// -----------------------------------  FX RELATED FIELDS  ----------------------------//
// ActivationFX                // continuous fx, remains on for duration of animation
// DeactivationFX              // fx triggered with deact bits
// HitFX                       // fx played after hit, can be on self or target
// -------------------------  FX RELATED FIELDS  --------------------------------------//
// -------------------------  FX RELATED FIELDS  --------------------------------------//
// WindUpFX                    // fx for windup if necessary
// BlockFX                     // fx for block
// DeathFX                     // fx for death
// InitialAttackFX             // fx for initial time it is triggered, can be different from looping attack fx for re-triggering
// AttackFX                    // fx for attack
// -------------------------  FX RELATED FIELDS  --------------------------------------//
// -------------------------  ANIMATION RELATED FIELDS --------------------------------//
// DelayedHit			 // boolean 0 or 1.  Used for delaying FX until a projectile hits a target